<title>UK: Croatia sets $300 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Croatia sets $300 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers UBS and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CROATIA</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    27.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+80 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	BBB-	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BAA3	DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
